# sessions/reid.ipynb: the SeaTurtleIDHeads download, the ALIKED feature cache, and
# the catalogue and sweep results built by scripts/reid_data.py and reid_sweep.py.
# The .npy/.npz arrays are already covered by extension above.
data/SeaTurtleIDHeads
data/turtle_aliked
data/turtle_catalogue.csv
data/turtle_arcface_sweep*.csv

# sessions/imbalanced.ipynb: the UCI poker hands (24 MB), fetched by
# `python download_data.py poker`. Not covered by any extension rule above.
data/poker-hand-*.data

# ...but that session's checkpoints ARE committed, against the *.p rule above.
# They are ~350 KB in total, they are what its load cells read, and without them
# the notebook cannot be run by anyone who has not first retrained it.
!data/poker_*.p

